{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/凛耀•流云剑幕","pageid":9047,"revid":22152,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%87%9B%E8%80%80%E2%80%A2%E6%B5%81%E4%BA%91%E5%89%91%E5%B9%95&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%87%9B%E8%80%80%E2%80%A2%E6%B5%81%E4%BA%91%E5%89%91%E5%B9%95&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%87%9B%E8%80%80%E2%80%A2%E6%B5%81%E4%BA%91%E5%89%91%E5%B9%95&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>凛耀•流云剑幕</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E5.87.9B.E8.80.80.E2.80.A2.E6.B5.81.E4.BA.91.E5.89.91.E5.B9.95\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"凛耀•流云剑幕\"><b>凛耀•流云剑幕</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E7%AE%80%E5%8D%95%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\"><img alt=\"技能 凛耀•流云剑幕.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/86/lgcla0spiu5ftfmxcc1pa3ku01sch5d.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%87%9B%E8%80%80%E2%80%A2%E6%B5%81%E4%BA%91%E5%89%91%E5%B9%95.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/86/lgcla0spiu5ftfmxcc1pa3ku01sch5d.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%87%9B%E8%80%80%E2%80%A2%E6%B5%81%E4%BA%91%E5%89%91%E5%B9%95.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/86/lgcla0spiu5ftfmxcc1pa3ku01sch5d.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />凛耀•流云剑幕\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><center><b>&#160;技能类别<br /></b>[反应]</center>\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\">&#160;\n<p>（反应）防御提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">40%</font>，拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"格挡\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">格挡</font></span></span>]和[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"震慑先制\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">震慑先制</font></span></span>]。<br />✦同时可以格挡魔法攻击、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">范围</span>]攻击。被任意方向攻击时，<font color=\"#ed7950\">100%</font>概率触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"格挡\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">格挡</font></span></span>]，且格挡时防御额外提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">40%</font>。<br />✦触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"震慑先制\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">震慑先制</font></span></span>]时（每回合可触发2次），以[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">普攻</span>]造成其一半伤害；若以[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"先制\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">先制</font></span></span>]击败目标或触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"十字锋芒\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">十字锋芒</font></span></span>]，则该回合先制次数增加<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>，每回合最多增加<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>次。\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%8B%84%E5%A5%A5%E5%A8%9C\" title=\"角色图鉴库/狄奥娜\"><img alt=\"头像 狄奥娜.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/6/69/3k01hs8h1x90i6tejnl6yrh46nftbx7.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">狄奥娜</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022012644\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.444 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.594 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 9894/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 160452/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 18210/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0